{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Design-System-für-Universität","created_at":"2025-01-15T13:17:09.082Z","published_at":"2025-07-18T10:01:31.816Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T10:01:31.833Z","id":609508389,"uuid":"67b526ed-802f-4fb8-89d2-230f2923a0c2","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"55e71210-21fc-4de8-a699-37ef0fa23e19","text":"Wir haben einer großen Universität dabei geholfen, ihr Design System mit einer [Design System-Initiative](/design-system-services/brauche-ich-ein-design-system) zu starten. Dies hat die Entscheidung des Brand- & Kommunikationsteams beeinflusst, das Startprojekt auf kickstartDS aufzusetzen und unser Content-Modul zu verwenden.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Entwickelt für zukunftsichere Skalierung","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Design System für eine große deutsche Universität","content_gutter":"","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"narrow","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"fae5fd9a-2de7-47a0-a94e-ee532363e410","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"acec41af-99e1-48e0-94fc-87bbb09864d2","stat":[{"_uid":"647a3fac-f949-4dfc-9d66-979fb5ae413d","type":"stat","title":"Design System","number":"1","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"5862f887-4f88-4090-82cb-c2855bfbcd0c","type":"stat","title":"Plattformen bereits produktiv","number":"2","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"6b4bd769-6dfd-4890-be49-9ba246f7757e","type":"stat","title":"Zentrale Instanzen avisiert","number":"10+","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"077d20ea-1250-4ee7-87e5-6beba795d501","icon":"","type":"stat","title":"potentielle Design System Anwender","number":"100+","component":"stat","description":""}],"type":"stats","component":"stats"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"fc8b3f19-e2ef-47a3-afc3-461ed2f8ae41","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"b0ea25c2-6fcf-4f87-b0f2-e4d959ef139e","text":"","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Screenshot-Zusammenstellung von verschiedenen Komponenten des Universitäts-Design System","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3004x1650/d36b4755cc/cover_uni-dsi.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"c4a57774-b411-4a5e-a61b-aed0e2d0c76c","type":"section","style":"","width":"narrow","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"2db3a1d8-17fc-490b-b342-4e484fd5bac8","text":"Die Universität plant einen vollständigen Relaunch ihrer Brand und Corporate Identity und will darauf vorbereitet sein, Hunderte verschiedener Websites, Landing Pages und Systeme von Drittanbietern, die jeweils von verschiedenen Personen betrieben werden, strategisch neu zu gestalten.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Markenkonsistenz, Skalierbarkeit und Anpassungsfähigkeit für alle zukünftigen digitalen Vorhaben","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Die Herausforderung","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"center","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"4ae46334-fe6f-40d1-86c8-6cb228357d38","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"0bd6290b-80c8-4355-9473-aa0bf95935eb","type":"gallery","images":[{"alt":"Foto von einem Miro-Board, welches das Design System Audit abbildet","src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/696x426/8f9c13af2e/design-system-audit-invenntory-mapping.webp","_uid":"c67c3402-e8ba-432e-bfde-e860fc1ba9aa","caption":"Foto von einem Miro-Board, welches das Design System Audit abbildet","component":"images"}],"layout":"stack","lightbox":false,"component":"gallery","aspectRatio":"unset"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"14502001-6ff1-419d-aa54-dc502bda798a","text":"Für die renommierte deutsche Universität entwickelten wir ein maßgeschneidertes, produktiv einsatzfähiges Design System. Dieses System wurde durch eine umfassende Dokumentation in Storybook ergänzt, die als zentrales Nachschlagewerk für Entwickler und Designer dient. \n\nUnser Ansatz garantierte nicht nur Konsistenz und Effizienz in der Gestaltung, sondern auch eine einfache Pflege und Weiterentwicklung der digitalen Plattformen der Universität.\n\nBereits im ersten produktiven Anwendungsfall konnten **40% Entwicklungszeit** aufgrund des Design Systems **eingespart** werden.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Komposition verschiedener UI Komponenten aus dem Design System","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1508x2454/a36dcd6a34/uni-ds-components.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"81775467-ffc2-494f-837f-7419b54c2511","text":"Wir folgten strikt dem bewährten Vorgehen unserer [Design System Initiative](/design-system-services/brauche-ich-ein-design-system). Beginnend mit einer gründlichen Analyse der bestehenden digitalen Infrastruktur und den spezifischen Anforderungen der Universität, arbeiteten wir eng mit den internen Teams zusammen.\n\nSchritt für Schritt entwickelten wir ein flexibles und skalierbares Design System, das sowohl die aktuellen als auch zukünftigen Anforderungen abdeckt. Durch iterative Feedback-Schleifen stellten wir sicher, dass alle Stakeholder eingebunden waren und das Endprodukt optimal auf die Bedürfnisse zugeschnitten war.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Komposition verschiedener UI Komponenten aus dem Design System","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/696x426/8f9c13af2e/design-system-audit-invenntory-mapping.webp","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n- Design System Konzept\n- Technische Konzeption\n- Frontend-Entwicklung\n- Dokumentation\n","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- React, Next.js\n- HTML & CSS, BEM\n- [kickstartDS](/design-system-services/design-system-starterkit-kickstartds)\n- [Storybook](/glossar/storybook)","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"46027e22-29d1-4900-ac1c-c40e26100ea7","text":"**Weiterführende Artikel**\n\n- [Design System Initiative](/design-system-services/brauche-ich-ein-design-system)\n- [Die Zeit ist reif für Designsysteme](/design-system-insights/die-zeit-ist-reif-fuer-designsysteme)","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default"},{"_uid":"4ae15635-19f0-4bc6-b309-2cbea840aff7","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"90298e20-7fdb-4adf-84ff-990e5989c075","text":"","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"Screenshot von dem aufgesetzten Design System in Storybook","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2165x1124/780290ba89/uni-storybook.png","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Die klare Strukturierung erleichtert es den Teams, neue Projekte schneller zu starten und bestehende Anwendungen effizienter zu pflegen. Zudem stärkte das Design System die digitale Markenidentität der Universität erheblich und trug dazu bei, ihre Position als Vorreiter im Bildungsbereich weiter auszubauen.\n\n**Die wirklich Kraft des strukturierten und systematisierten Vorgehens wird sich 2025 im Zuge des anstehenden Re-Brandings erst recht beweisen.** ","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","